<span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111;letter-spacing:0.02em;">GOLD: AUGUST CONTRACT</span>
<span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111;">$4,167.50</span>
<span style="font-size:13px;color:#2e7d32;">&#9650; $41.80</span>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-left:auto;">DAILY &nbsp;|&nbsp; MAR 27 TO JUL 6 2026</span>
