<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: BNN Bloomberg and CNBC daily crude oil market reports, April 16 to July 6 2026. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
