If you manage your own energy or resource exposure, this is a useful moment to talk through what is actually driving prices right now versus what the headlines suggest. Would you be open to a short call?<br><br>
[Your Name]<br><br>
<em>This communication is for educational purposes only and does not constitute personalized investment advice.</em>
</div>
<button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyEmail(''prospect-email'', this)">Copy email</button>
</div>',
