<p>Clients focused on Friday''s TSX record may be confused or mildly concerned by Monday''s pullback, particularly if they hold concentrated gold mining positions that led Friday''s rally and gave back some ground. Clients watching US markets set fresh records while Canada pulls back may also wonder if they are underexposed to US equities.</p>
</div>
<div class="toolkit-section">
