<p><strong>High impact:</strong> Clients with concentrated gold mining or energy sector positions who saw outsized moves in both directions over the past week and may be looking for reassurance on the underlying thesis.</p>
<p><strong>Mixed impact:</strong> Clients with balanced Canada and US exposure, who saw one side of their portfolio pull back while the other set records, a normal outcome of sector rotation rather than a problem to fix.</p>
<p><strong>Potential benefit:</strong> Clients overweight Canadian financials, which continued to benefit from a stable rate outlook even as materials and energy pulled back.</p>
</div>
